---
import { steps } from '../lib/questions.mjs';
import {
  ArrowLeft, ArrowRight, CircleCheck, CircleHelp, ClipboardList,
  Download, Info, ListChecks, PanelLeftClose, PanelLeftOpen, RotateCcw, ShieldCheck,
} from '@lucide/astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es" data-theme="institutional">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#084682" />
    <meta name="description" content="Ficha de ingreso para iniciativas de desarrollo de software institucional." />
    <title>Ficha de proyecto | Desarrollo institucional</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-base-200 text-base-content">
    <div id="app-shell" class="app-shell" data-intro-open="true">
      <aside id="intro-panel" class="intro-panel hero-wash bg-neutral text-neutral-content" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="intro-content">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white text-neutral"><ClipboardList size={21} aria-hidden="true" /></span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight">Desarrollo institucional</span>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-copy">
            <span class="badge badge-outline border-white/40 text-neutral-content">Prototipo de ingreso</span>
            <p class="mt-10 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-sky-institutional">Nueva iniciativa de software</p>
            <h1 id="page-title" class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-.045em]">Una ficha simple para <span class="text-sky-institutional">empezar bien.</span></h1>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-content/85">Selecciona las opciones que describen tu proyecto. La ficha ayuda a identificar las revisiones necesarias antes de desarrollar o poner una solución en uso.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Características de la ficha">
              <span class="badge border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-neutral-content"><ListChecks size={14} aria-hidden="true" /> 3 pasos</span>
              <span class="badge border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-neutral-content"><CircleCheck size={14} aria-hidden="true" /> Solo selecciones</span>
              <span class="badge border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-neutral-content"><ShieldCheck size={14} aria-hidden="true" /> Sin envío de datos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card mt-9 border border-white/20 bg-white/10 shadow-none" aria-label="Información importante">
            <div class="card-body gap-3 p-5">
              <span class="grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-white/15 text-sky-institutional"><Info size={19} aria-hidden="true" /></span>
              <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sky-institutional">Antes de comenzar</h2>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-content/85">Esta versión genera una preevaluación orientativa. La recepción se integrará con un sistema interno privado; todavía no emite autorizaciones.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="main-column min-w-0">
        <header class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <nav class="navbar mx-auto max-w-5xl gap-3 px-4 sm:px-8" aria-label="Navegación principal">
            <button id="intro-toggle" type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm gap-2" aria-controls="intro-panel" aria-expanded="true">
              <PanelLeftClose id="intro-toggle-icon-open" size={18} aria-hidden="true" />
              <PanelLeftOpen id="intro-toggle-icon-closed" size={18} aria-hidden="true" hidden />
              <span id="intro-toggle-label">Ocultar introducción</span>
            </button>
            <span class="badge badge-outline ml-auto hidden border-primary/30 text-primary sm:inline-flex">Ficha de proyecto</span>
          </nav>
        </header>

    <main class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pb-16 pt-10 sm:px-8">
      <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3 px-1">
        <div>
          <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-primary">Punto de partida</p>
          <h2 id="form-title" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Ficha de proyecto</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Ninguna respuesta requiere escribir.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="grid gap-5" aria-labelledby="form-title">
        <div class="card border border-base-300 bg-base-100 shadow-sm" aria-label="Progreso de la ficha">
          <div class="card-body gap-3 p-5 sm:p-6">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-base-content/50">Tu recorrido</p>
            <ol class="steps steps-horizontal w-full text-xs sm:text-sm">
              {steps.map((step, index) => (
                <li class:list={['step', { 'step-primary': index === 0 }]} data-step-indicator={index} aria-current={index === 0 ? 'step' : undefined}>{step.title}</li>
              ))}
            </ol>
            <div class="alert alert-info alert-soft items-start text-xs leading-relaxed" role="note">
              <CircleHelp size={18} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span>Si no conoces una respuesta, selecciona “No lo sé”. Quedará señalada para revisión.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card min-w-0 border border-base-300 bg-base-100 shadow-xl shadow-neutral/5">
          <div class="card-body p-5 sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
            <div class="mb-2 flex justify-between text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-base-content/55"><span id="progress-label">Paso 1 de 3</span><span id="progress-count">33%</span></div>
            <progress id="progress-track" class="progress progress-primary mb-7 w-full" value="33" max="100" aria-label="Progreso de la ficha"></progress>

            <form id="intake-form" novalidate>
              <div id="error-summary" class="alert alert-error alert-soft mb-6 items-start" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden>
                <Info size={20} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
                <div><strong>Faltan respuestas en este paso</strong><p class="text-sm">Selecciona una opción en cada pregunta señalada para continuar.</p></div>
              </div>

              {steps.map((step, index) => (
                <section class="form-step" data-step={index} hidden={index !== 0} aria-labelledby={`step-title-${index}`}>
                  <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-primary">{step.eyebrow}</p>
                  <h3 id={`step-title-${index}`} class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">{step.title}</h3>
                  <p class="mb-8 mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/60">{step.description}</p>

                  {step.questions.map((question, questionIndex) => (
                    <fieldset class="question mb-8" data-question={question.key}>
                      <legend class="mb-3 flex items-baseline gap-3 text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary">{String(index * 3 + questionIndex + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{question.label}</legend>
                      <div class="option-grid grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
                        {question.options.map(([value, label]) => (
                          <label class="option-card flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-snug hover:border-primary/55 hover:bg-base-200" for={`${question.key}-${value}`}>
                            <input class="radio radio-primary radio-sm shrink-0" id={`${question.key}-${value}`} type="radio" name={question.key} value={value} />
                            <span>{label}</span>
                          </label>
                        ))}
                      </div>
                      <p class="field-error mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-error" id={`${question.key}-error`} hidden>Selecciona una opción para continuar.</p>
                    </fieldset>
                  ))}
                </section>
              ))}

              <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 border-t border-base-300 pt-6">
                <button type="button" id="back-button" class="btn btn-ghost" hidden><ArrowLeft size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Volver</button>
                <button type="button" id="next-button" class="btn btn-primary ml-auto"><span class="button-label">Continuar</span><ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></button>
              </div>
            </form>

            <section id="result" class="result" hidden aria-labelledby="result-title">
              <span class="mb-4 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-box bg-success/10 text-success"><CircleCheck size={26} aria-hidden="true" /></span>
              <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-primary">Ficha completada</p>
              <h3 id="result-title" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Preevaluación lista</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/65">Tus selecciones generan esta orientación inicial. Aún no se ha enviado ninguna solicitud.</p>
              <div class="alert alert-info alert-soft assessment my-6 block" id="assessment">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.13em]">Nivel orientativo</span>
                <strong id="assessment-title" class="mt-1 block text-xl"></strong>
                <p id="assessment-summary" class="mt-1 text-sm"></p>
              </div>
              <div id="reasons-wrap" hidden><h4 class="text-sm font-bold">Factores detectados</h4><ul id="assessment-reasons" class="mt-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-sm"></ul></div>
              <p id="unknowns-note" class="alert alert-warning alert-soft mt-5 text-sm" hidden></p>
              <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <button type="button" id="download-button" class="btn btn-primary"><Download size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Descargar ficha</button>
                <button type="button" id="reset-button" class="btn btn-ghost"><RotateCcw size={17} aria-hidden="true" />Crear otra ficha</button>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-base-content/55">La descarga queda en tu equipo. Antes de compartirla, confirma el canal institucional apropiado.</p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-t border-base-300 px-5 py-6 text-xs text-base-content/50 sm:px-8"><span>Arquitectura y desarrollo seguro · Borrador de trabajo</span><span>La evaluación automática no constituye aprobación.</span></footer>
      </div>
    </div>
    <script>import '../scripts/form.js';</script>
  </body>
</html>
